{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Sarek_vulkan.Vulkan_api_transfer</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"sarek-vulkan","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Sarek_vulkan","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Vulkan_api_transfer","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Ranged host&lt;-&gt;device copies (specs/vulkan-async-api.md).</p><p>Every copy completes before it returns. It first completes the device's pending launches (<a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#val-drain_pending\"><code>Vulkan_api_device.drain_pending</code></a>), so it never lands under a kernel still using the buffer and always sees what a kernel wrote; a copy issued before a launch is visible to it (the launch is recorded after the copy has finished).</p><p>Three paths, by where the host bytes and the device bytes live:</p><ul><li>the host range lies inside an import (<a href=\"../Vulkan_api_host/index.html\"><code>Vulkan_api_host</code></a>) and the host cannot access the device buffer at memory speed (unmapped, or uncached for reads), or a write of at least <a href=\"#val-dma_min_bytes\"><code>dma_min_bytes</code></a>: one <code>vkCmdCopyBuffer</code> straight between the import and the device buffer (DMA, no staging, no host <code>memcpy</code>);</li><li>the device buffer is host-mapped and the host side may touch it (<code>mapped_cached</code> for reads: uncached BAR memory reads at ~0.03 GB/s): one <code>memcpy</code> at the byte offset;</li><li>otherwise: a staging buffer of exactly the range, one <code>memcpy</code> and one <code>vkCmdCopyBuffer</code>; read-back staging is HOST_CACHED when available.</li></ul>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Device\"><a href=\"#module-Device\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> Device</span><span> = <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html\">Vulkan_api_device</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Memory\"><a href=\"#module-Memory\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> Memory</span><span> = <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_memory/index.html\">Vulkan_api_memory</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec module anchored\" id=\"module-Host\"><a href=\"#module-Host\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> Host</span><span> = <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_host/index.html\">Vulkan_api_host</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-total_bytes\"><a href=\"#val-total_bytes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> total_bytes : <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../Vulkan_api_memory/index.html#type-buffer\">Memory.buffer</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-advance\"><a href=\"#val-advance\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> advance : <span><span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-record_copy\"><a href=\"#val-record_copy\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> record_copy : \u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_command_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_command_buffer</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes_static</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src</span>:<a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_buffer</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">src_offset</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst</span>:<a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_buffer</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">dst_offset</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  unit</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-dma_min_bytes\"><a href=\"#val-dma_min_bytes\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> dma_min_bytes : int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Host-to-device into a MAPPED buffer from a pinned range: below this many bytes a <code>memcpy</code> beats the submission and fence wait of a DMA copy (4 MiB: 19.0 vs 16.7 GB/s; 16 MiB: 19.0 vs 21.6 GB/s; RX 7900 XTX, H7 bench).</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-with_staging\"><a href=\"#val-with_staging\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> with_staging : \u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?cached</span>:bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../Vulkan_api_device/index.html#type-t\">Memory.Device.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">byte_size</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">usage</span>:int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_buffer\">Vulkan_types.vk_buffer</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>unit <spa